{"Version":1,"ProgramText":"SCREEN 640,480\n\nSAM PLAY \u0022Sound/Scout.mp3\u0022\n\nINKG WHITE\nCONFIGFONT 70,100,\u0022Courier New\u0022\nPRINTG AT 1,7,\u0022PHALANX\u0022\nPRINTG AT 2,8,\u0022RULES\u0022\n\nSCREEN SELECT 1\nINKG Red\nRASTER 15,0,0,100\nRASTER 21, 0, 1, 0 \nRASTER STR(15)=\u0022Red,Orange\u0022\nCONFIGFONT 100,130,\u0022Courier New\u0022\nPRINTG AT 0,0,\u0022TJOSAN\u0022\n\nSCREEN SELECT 0\n\nDOUBLE BUFFER\n\nY=0\n\nVY=0\nVX=0\nMainLoop:\n  SCREEN SELECT 1\n  RASTER 15,0,0,120\n  RASTER STR(15)=\u0022Blue, Red\u0022\u0027\n  RASTER 21, 0, 1, 0 \n  SCREEN SELECT 0\n\n  PARTICLE 2,40\n  RASTER 21, 0, 1, 0 \n  RASTER 1,0,Y,80\n  RASTER 2,0,Y\u002B80,80\n  RASTER STR(1)=\u0022Red,Orange\u0022\n  RASTER STR(2)=\u0022Orange,Yellow\u0022\n  RASTER 3,0,Y\u002B160,80\n  RASTER STR(3)=\u0022Yellow,Green\u0022\n  RASTER 4,0,Y\u002B240,80\n  RASTER STR(4)=\u0022Green,Blue\u0022\n  RASTER 5,0,Y\u002B320,80\n  RASTER STR(5)=\u0022Blue,Indigo\u0022\n  RASTER 6,0,Y\u002B400,80\n  RASTER STR(6)=\u0022Indigo, Violet\u0022\n  RASTER 7,0,Y\u002B480,80\n  RASTER STR(7)=\u0022Violet, Red\u0022\n\n  RASTER 8,0,Y\u002B0\u002B560,80\n  RASTER STR(8)=\u0022Red,Orange\u0022\n  RASTER 9,0,Y\u002B80\u002B560,80\n  RASTER STR(9)=\u0022Orange,Yellow\u0022\n  RASTER 10,0,Y\u002B160\u002B560,80\n  RASTER STR(10)=\u0022Yellow,Green\u0022\n  RASTER 11,0,Y\u002B240\u002B560,80\n  RASTER STR(11)=\u0022Green,Blue\u0022\n  RASTER 12,0,Y\u002B320\u002B560,80\n  RASTER STR(12)=\u0022Blue,Indigo\u0022\n  RASTER 13,0,Y\u002B400\u002B560,80\n  RASTER STR(13)=\u0022Indigo, Violet\u0022\n  RASTER 14,0,Y\u002B480\u002B560,80\n  RASTER STR(14)=\u0022Violet, Red\u0022\n\n  Y=Y-1\n  IF Y=-560 THEN Y=0\n\n  SCROLL 0,SIN(VX)*20,SIN(-VY)*200-190\n  VY=VY\u002B1\n  IF VY=180 THEN VY=0\n  \n  VX=VX\u002B10\n  IF VX=360 THEN VX=0\n    \n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO MainLoop\n","ScreenWidth":640,"ScreenHeight":480,"Sprites":[],"MapWidth":1,"MapHeight":1,"MapData":[-1]}